      "body": "> this has been reported to [secp256k1-security@bitcoin.org](mailto:secp256k1-security@bitcoin.org) independently of the Antrophic scan\r\n\r\nAnd let me also add that we don't consider this a vulnerability. Technically, crashing can be a security issue, but this crash is clean and will be caught by minimal testing on the caller side, so that no one should hit this case in production.\r\n",
